ivered products or an agreed milestone."}]]}],["$","p","3",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"This difference matters for Indian freelancers, contractors, agencies, repair businesses and consultants. A contractor may inspect a renovation site and send a business estimate first. A web designer may send an estimate before starting design work. Once the customer approves and the job is done, the business sends an invoice."}]]}],["$","p","4",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"InvoiceWala helps with both sides. Create an estimate or quotation using the "}],["$","$L13","1",{"className":"font-semibold text-cyan-300 underline-offset-2 hover:underline","href":"/quotation-maker","children":"Quotation Maker"}],["$","span","2",{"children":", then create an invoice using the "}],["$","$L13","3",{"className":"font-semibold text-cyan-300 underline-offset-2 hover:underline","href":"/free-invoice-generator","children":"Invoice Generator"}],["$","span","4",{"children":" when payment is due."}]]}],["$","h2","5",{"className":"mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-white","children":"Quick Answer"}],["$","p","6",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Use an estimate before work begins."}]]}],["$","p","7",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Use an invoice after work is approved or completed and payment is due."}]]}],["$","p","8",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"An estimate is a preliminary pricing document. An invoice is a payment request and accounting record."}]]}],["$","div","9",{"className":"mt-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-white/10","children":"$L15"}],"$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","